# novadeck: enable the SteamOS-Manager compatibility backend on release — SteamUI's Performance/GPU
# sliders (and future Desktop/Game switching) call com.steampowered.SteamOSManager1 through it, and it
# forwards to novadeck-powerd. Same first-boot preset-all rationale as 60-novadeck-powerd. It is also
# D-Bus activatable via the system-service file; enabling it just starts it eagerly at boot.
enable novadeck-steamos-manager.service
